    "updated_at": "2017-02-21T17:50:35Z",
    "body": "We could do the latter as well, provided it's somehow limited to these event classes. I mainly want to dissuade others from trying to copy that pattern, although I guess we should consult with some implementers to make sure this doesn't happen in more places before we commit.",
