    "created_at": "2018-03-15T16:21:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-15T16:21:59Z",
    "body": "I've done an initial step here: #603.\r\n\r\nHow exactly do we deal with subclasses here? I think each event class needs to have some associated steps that by default don't do anything. Then when constructing an event we call these steps for each class in the chain?",
