    "updated_at": "2018-03-23T11:50:16Z",
    "body": "Okay, so based on reading OP again I think the best way forward here is a single callback. UI events can then define the implementation of this callback for WheelEvent, MouseEvent, KeyboardEvent. That implementation would call shared algorithms that can handle the bits identical across these interfaces.",
